        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "          300 Zauzian Racguangc Ata 'Duanghlou",
            "                             9.9.9.10. Ref. 5. 5. 8.5",
            "          Doh hei Gb",
            "",
            "          1. Zauzian Racguangc ata duanghlou o;",
            "             Neihlaamei ai ariw ngammak ge.",
            "             Nang rui hamhna neihlaa kim khang maek;",
            "             Nduanghlou o, Kanloumeipu Ravguangc.",
            "",
            "                  Tingkauhramc gay khou, (2)",
            "                  Nduanghlou o, Kanloumeipu;",
            "                  Tingkauh ramc gay khou.",
            "",
            "          2. Ryanraa zaengsina kap bam khouhei,",
            "             Nang zauzian khwan rui tikimlou o.",
            "             Kapmei tingmik hei twan pwni the,",
            "             Ringhmei thingbang lim khou zaengsw 'ni the.",
            "",
            "          3. Nkhwan bam e arup-ryan guay rui;",
            "             Ringhmei thing lim khou zaengsw 'chamc khang.",
            "             'Zianmei nunc bammei tingkauh ramc khou,",
            "             Nduanghlou o, Kanloumeipu Ravguangc."
          ]
        }
      }
    },
